  s3: Exact close confirmed#59; retire and settle
  s4: Old execution retired#59; exclusion still held
  s5: Exclusion released#59; reply pending
  s6: Owner turn began a launch
  s7: Exclusion released#59; reply pending#59; owner not woken
  s8: Seed waits for the owner
  s9: Owner turn installed Pending
  s10: Seed waits for the owner#59; owner not woken
  s11: CheckEpoch observed#59; live BeginEffect still required
  s12: BeginEffect holds create authority
  s13: Create answered#59; first input not submitted
  s14: CheckEpoch observed#59; live input authority still required
  s15: BeginEffect holds input authority
  s16: First input submitted#59; receipt not committed
  s17: Receipt committed#59; source not bound
  s18: One new Ready session#59; inputs await the owner
  s19: One new Ready session#59; inputs settled once
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Commit the seed original (acceptance)
  s1 --> s2: Terminate takes transition and fence
  s2 --> s2: Owner drive parks until a wake
  s2 --> s3: Close only the captured pane
  s3 --> s4: Retire CAS and settle the old turn
  s4 --> s5: Disconnect keeping selector, release, wake
  s5 --> s6: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s5 --> s8: Reply to the command
  s4 --> s7: Disconnect keeping selector, release without a wake
  s6 --> s9: Install Pending over the vacant row
  s7 --> s10: Reply to the command
  s8 --> s6: Owner starts the front: register the launch
  s9 --> s11: Observe the create epoch
  s11 --> s12: Compare live epoch and retain create permission
  s12 --> s13: Complete the previously granted create
  s13 --> s14: Observe the input epoch
  s14 --> s15: Compare live epoch and retain input permission
  s15 --> s16: Complete the previously granted first input
  s16 --> s17: Commit the input's receipt
  s17 --> s18: Bind the source
  s18 --> s19: Submit an input to the successor once
